{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S03、S06等段落感受提示过于密集，尤其S08—S11停留时间较短，容易来不及扫完；Y的左右分栏更容易快速定位和阅读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然阅读负担更大，但【】高亮让每段叙事重点容易被抓住，感受提示又能跟随音乐具体展开，尤其把舍不得被当作自己人、害怕孤单、不愿重新忍受委屈这几层情绪连接得比较完整。Y的因果解释更顺畅，左右分栏也更适合快速扫读，但部分感受被概括得较粗，S09等处还弱化了核心的情感对象。综合来看，X更能让观众既理解人物的内心变化，又实际感受到音乐中细腻而反复的心理波动。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b5d451a4-dfa9-4037-a459-1f1e58d27ffd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T000812611203Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.937, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:08:57.552401+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9c38af104d0ca7d05b7d5eaf979532a4d8d20e5b6b5d146d433d73df52018611", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\ch